##gff-version 3
# Four genes whose isoforms differ only in how the annotation says which one
# represents the gene, written in the spellings real files use. Every gene's
# TAGGED transcript is the SHORTER protein, so a collapse that kept it can only
# have read the tag.
#
#   MANEG    tag=MANE Select                       NCBI's GFF3: one value, a space in it
#   GENCG    tag=basic,...,MANE_Select,...         GENCODE's: a comma list, an underscore in it
#   ENSG     tag=basic,Ensembl_canonical           a canonical with no MANE beside it
#   PLAING   (none)                                nothing to read; protein length decides
ctgA	NCBI	CDS	1000	1600	.	+	0	ID=cds-NM_000001.1;Parent=rna-NM_000001.1
ctgA	NCBI	CDS	1000	3000	.	+	0	ID=cds-NM_000002.1-1;Parent=rna-NM_000002.1
